                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really liked this game. It's uniquely VR title and a puzzle game - kinda like Tetris but in VR. The first few levels were very easy and just required matching blocks. As the game progressed into the second and thrid environments, it added more complexity including a throwing game and special power ups that made it fun and replayable.  I would recommend this game to anyone looking for a non-shoorter VR game.",
